    "all_ok": false,
    "finding": "FAIL \u2014 Rollback is NOT atomic. LearningItem.save_item succeeded and transitioned status to DEPRECATED in-memory, but save_deprecation_record failed and was not retried/compensated. Audit trail split: item shows deprecated, but no DeprecationRecord exists."
  },
